### Send analytics events

POST https://127.0.0.1/api/analytics HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    {
      "name": "page_view",
      "properties": {
        "page": "/home"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "page_load",
      "properties": {
        "page": "/home",
        "duration_ms": "142"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "click",
      "properties": {
        "component": "navbar",
        "action": "login_button"
      }
    }
  ]
}

### Send a single event

POST https://127.0.0.1/api/analytics HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "events": [
    {
      "name": "error",
      "properties": {
        "page": "/dashboard",
        "message": "failed to load data"
      }
    }
  ]
}
